      {
        "key": "on",
        "values": [
          "offer"
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "conversation",
            "values": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "key": "scene",
                "values": [
                  "scene/3hai"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "While inspecting the main propulsion of your spaceship a group of three hai approach. The leading hai speaks to you.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\"Hello, this spaceship seems to be in pretty good shape. I would like to speak to the captain.\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "After you told him that you are the captain, it turns out that the hai is looking for a passenger transport for him and his two assistants.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "Like always you ask for details of the transport, just to avoid trouble.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "His name is Dr. Lufbin, and he travels with his two assistants to a robotics conference on Allhome. The payment would be 100.000 credits. He admits that he is afraid of space travel and rejected several transport possibilities because the ships looked bad maintained.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\"So, would you take us to Allhome?\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "choice",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"Yes, I'm soon done with my checkups.\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "goto",
                        "values": [
                          "thanks"
                        ],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"Sorry, I'm busy repairing the ship for the next days.\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "goto",
                        "values": [
                          "no"
                        ],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "label",
                "values": [
                  "thanks"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\tYou lead your passengers to their bunks and get everything ready for the flight.",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "accept",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "label",
                "values": [
                  "no"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\t\"Too bad, safe ships are so rare on this spaceport.\" You say goodbye and continue with your work.",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "defer",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "on",
        "values": [
          "complete"
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "payment",
            "values": [
              100000
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "conversation",
            "values": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "key": "scene",
                "values": [
                  "scene/3hai_park"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "You land on <destination>. Dr. Lufbin thanks you for the safe transport and pays you 100.000 credits.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\"I've seen the androids that work on your ship and I would love to study one of them. Of course I would pay you for that. If you are interested, meet me at the spaceport in a few hours.\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
