        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "conversation",
            "values": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "key": "Back at the spaceport, Dr. Lufbin asks you to transport him and his assistants back to his robotic laboratory on Snowfeather. Furthermore, he would like to rent one of your androids to study it.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\"I will pay you 100.000 credits for the transport and 150.000 credits for renting the android. And I guess I will need it for like 30 days. Do we have a deal?\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "choice",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "\"\tOk, I think I can spare an android for a month\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "goto",
                        "values": [
                          "thanks"
                        ],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "\"\tNo, sorry, I can't afford a smaller android crew.\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "goto",
                        "values": [
                          "no"
                        ],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "label",
                "values": [
                  "thanks"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\tDr. Lufbin seems very happy. He cancels his other speeches at the conference and head back to your ship to continue studying the android.",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "accept",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "label",
                "values": [
                  "no"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\tDr. Lufbin seems very disappointed. He says goodbye and heads back to the conference.",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "decline",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
