                "key": "He hands you 300.000 credits while some workers transport the 'NDR-114 Android' back on your ship.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\"The additional credits express how helpful your contribution was to my work. My company, 'Snowfeather Robotics', now sells SFR-100 worker androids and other models at the local outfitter.\"",
